      "title": {
        "en": "Recurring grievances concerning floor service"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While a couple of pet owners appreciated attentive service from individual floor associates and a gentle groomer, most reviewers voice serious frustration with staff behavior. Complaints cite dismissive customer service, argumentative responses during price-match requests, and unhelpful management interactions when issues were escalated."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Store maintenance issues and register bottlenecks"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report frequent operational and facility challenges inside the store and grooming salon. Visitors mention long checkout queues caused by a single open register, broken climate control in the grooming area, early door closures before posted operating hours, and neglected fish tanks with dead or sickly betta fish."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Divergent outcomes in pet grooming services"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customer reports on grooming services differ sharply between visits. One reviewer expressed deep satisfaction with a patient stylist who handled a pet with gentleness. However, other clients reported choppy haircuts, pet injuries, and inadequate follow-up communication from salon supervisors after grooming appointments."
      }
    }
  ],
